    // search (codex BLOCKER). The leading segment `Foo` binds at the call site
    // via a NAMED IMPORT `use crate::a::Foo;` — a `BindTarget::Pending` binding —
    // and there is NO block-local shadow/glob (so ①C does not fire; ②B is the
